{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37182","headline":"邓表山 · 郑啓","name":"邓表山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"白日三清此上时，观开山下彩云飞。\n仙坛丹竈灵犹在，鹤驾清朝去不归。\n晋末几迁陵谷改，尘中空换子孙非。\n松花落尽无消息，半夜疎钟彻翠微。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑啓","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37182.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37182","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}